#{[17592186527102 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186526554 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186526560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186526577 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186526913 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186526919 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186526560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527102 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d4504051-feaa-512b-9211-403c240f5138" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527178 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186527102 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527178 #edb/ref 1069 "q-111250" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527178 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527178 #edb/ref 1071 "The random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2},\\, & 0\\le x\\le 2,\\,0\\le y\\le 1, \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind $P(X>Y).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527178 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "86df2b6f-b298-58e2-a359-d3e3b918ef94" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527178 #edb/ref 1074 "If $f(x,y)$ is a joint probability density function for the random variables $X$ and $Y$ and $A⊂{R}^{2},$ then\n\n$$\nP((X,Y)\\in A)={∬}_{A}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x,y)$ is nonnegative in the region $D=[0,2]\\times [0,1],$ and the event $A=\\{X>Y\\}$ corresponds to a subset of $D,$ shown as the shaded region below:\n\n![](images/2d/2db85950b4d45901d79c173f264173d0c38046b2f087d0a28c8d5c69f024e31f.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X>Y) & ={∬}_{A}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={∬}_{A}\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\text{Area}(A) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527260 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "778fed79-52b3-5022-a995-2a36a56152e4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527260 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186527178 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527264 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186527273 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527264 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "801fa807-3352-5bd1-814d-b25000e22228" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527264 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162298 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527273 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186527277 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527273 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a5964aa6-3d4d-5b0d-8edc-acec2fd46d0d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527273 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527277 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186527282 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527277 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c59b87d3-3574-5bfd-8921-7d04759f0077" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527277 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186247211 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527282 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186527260 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527282 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e4e368b7-f8df-565c-b934-2de97cefe731" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186527282 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186247214 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
